            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-21T22:30:56.807864+00:00",
            "notes": "You got some flexibility for powers here, really depends on what you think the team needs but I like these options\n\n[Supply Surge](item_35d75d9e-66b7-426a-b92d-9dfd72ee5fbb) is great if your primary targets for this know about it so they can make use of it. Primary targets should be heroes who really benefit from the cooldown reduction - Zarya, Juno, etc. \n  Some cooldowns aren't able to be reduced until the ability plays out for a bit - Junker queen shout you need to wait till it ends, rein charge, pharah dash barrage takes a sec and so on. \n\n[Tethered Tourniquet](item_9ac02f9a-7c06-46a3-94d4-2ba9a9cf623f) If you find you don't have time to rez because you need to constantly heal. Now you can swap to blaster and keep healing while rezzing (this will lead to glock mercy as well)\n\njust make big stat numbers w/ cash, you should have good options this round",
